  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/1420",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px dashed rgb(121, 165, 228); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;#일주운동 #천구 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px dashed rgb(121, 165, 228); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">#일주운동 #천구 </span></b></p></div></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">일주운동의 경우,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">플라스틱의 돔형을 쓰면 방위별 일주 방향을 쉽게 이해를 하는데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">1번쓰는 플라스틱을 쓸 때마다 많이 고민이 되더라구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">모양이 좀 어설퍼서&#160;직관적인 이해는 떨어집니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991649355F48B3C422\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991649355F48B3C422\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"724\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;ㄷ 자 형의 종이와, 원의 종이 2개를 이용합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만드는 방법은 아래 동영상과 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0gp4cbtxtj30wvnav6fvgvz@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S640x360/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frv0gp4cbtxtj30wvnav6fvgvz%2Fthumbs%2F2.org&amp;scode=kakaotv&amp;wm_id=kakaotv_7\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0gp4cbtxtj30wvnav6fvgvz?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MGdwNGNidHh0ajMwd3ZuYXY2ZnZndnoiLCJ0aWQiOiJjODVjMGJlNi1iOGI5LTQwOWYtYmJkZi1hNWI2MTFhODA5NzYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODU0MDl9.jWe-O6XQSxWUunR4N7TykXtoft2OtXjSZr9116ZJzT8X-C5Q2zW9bpsd32tkxGbC91bn7-ly_HMmfFrreRJtfQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">ㄷ자와 원형을 합체하는 방법은</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CCBB345F48B4B927\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CCBB345F48B4B927\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"474\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이 그림을 그려주니 좀 더 잘 이해하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">원래 플라스틱 돔으로 만드는게 더 직관적이다. 원래 동이여야 하는데,</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">환경을 위해 띠만 표현했다고 생각해보자...고 판을 깔면 좀 더 나은 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9907C23B5F48B41629\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9907C23B5F48B41629\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F63F3B5F48B41624\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F63F3B5F48B41624\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99090A3B5F48B41629\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99090A3B5F48B41629\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"480\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">이렇게 지평면 위에 관측자를 꽂으면 방위별 일주를 알 수 있습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CFF53B5F48B4172B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99CFF53B5F48B4172B\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"495\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E7E03B5F48B4172A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E7E03B5F48B4172A\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"479\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F85F3B5F48B41724\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F85F3B5F48B41724\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"491\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992C113B5F48B41823\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992C113B5F48B41823\" data-origin-width=\"640\" data-origin-height=\"489\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만드는 법은 쉬워서 실시간 수업으로 같이 설명을 해도 잘 이해하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">프린트를 못하는 아이는 센치를 적아주고 그리라고 하였습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">대충 그려라 미술시간 아니니 가로로 길게만 만들어라~ 하면서요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">만들기는 잘하는데</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">보는 법을 더 어려워하더라구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">천구에 대한 이해가 충분해야 쉽게 이해를 하는데, 그러기엔 시간이 너무 부족한 것 같습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">마음 편안한 주말되시길 바래요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">*^-----^*</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
